---
description: Do not start local game servers or use an in-app browser for playtesting
alwaysApply: true
---

# Local Runtime

- Do **not** start the game server (`pnpm --filter @august/server start:world`,
  `tsx apps/server/src/index.ts`, or systemd restarts for casual testing) unless the user
  explicitly asks.
- Do **not** start the client dev server (`pnpm --filter @august/client start` or
  `craco start`) unless the user explicitly asks.
- The user already runs the server themselves and plays in an **external browser**.
  Prefer that; do not open or drive an in-app browser for gameplay verification unless
  they ask.
- When verifying production, prefer `curl`/CLI checks, Vercel CLI, or SSH logs. Only use browser tools if the user requests visual verification.
- Deploying to Vercel or the VPS is fine when asked; that is not the same as starting a
  local agent-managed server.
